      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Reedville%2C_Virginia"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The first menhaden factory opened in 1875, and by 1885 Reedville boasted fifteen processing plants.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.dhr.virginia.gov/historic-registers/066-0083/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Millionaire's Row features Victorian mansions that earned a spot on the National Register of Historic Places.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Reedville%2C_Virginia"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Two historic fishing vessels, the Somers and the Elva C, are listed on the National Register.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
